Package: acih
Type: Package
Title: Active-Coordinate Inference for Sparse Additive Hazards Regression under Informative Subsampling
Version: 1.3.3
Authors@R: person("Zili", "Liu", email = "ZLiu20@mdanderson.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Lin-Ying additive hazards estimating equations with risk-set
    centring, GSELO screening with EBIC on a screening split, split-full and
    inverse-probability-weighted refits under with-replacement and Poisson
    (including event-complete) subsampling with inference-oriented allocation,
    the total sandwich covariance, and the simulation study and data-analysis
    protocol of the manuscript, with LSF scripts for a cluster.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports: stats, utils, graphics, grDevices
